# Flow 3, preview and tick: task boxes ticked in the preview by Tab + Enter and by a tap (one byte changes, the atomic
# save, the preview drawn again in place), a nested task too; in the editor by Ctrl+Enter on the cursor's line and by
# More > Tick task on this line.
seed note "Packing.md" tasks.md
wait 900
key ctrl-p
type packing
key enter
wait 500
expect state page preview
expect state boxes 4
shot 01-preview
check preview
key tab
wait 200
expect state ring 0
key enter
wait 300
expect state last_save ok
expect file "Packing.md" contains "- [x] Charger"
expect state ring 0
shot 02-ticked-by-keys
taptask 1
wait 300
expect file "Packing.md" contains "- [x] Spare keyboard"
taptask 2
wait 300
expect file "Packing.md" contains "- [ ] Deck"
taptask 3
wait 300
expect file "Packing.md" contains "  - [x] Nested task under the deck"
shot 03-ticked-by-taps
# the editor: Ctrl+Enter on the line of the cursor
key ctrl-e
wait 400
expect state page editor
key down
key down
key ctrl-enter
wait 1700
expect file "Packing.md" contains "- [ ] Charger"
shot 04-editor-ctrl-enter
key ctrl-o
wait 400
expect state popup menu
tap "Tick task on this line"
wait 1700
expect file "Packing.md" contains "- [x] Charger"
# not a task line: a notice
key ctrl-home
key ctrl-enter
wait 200
expect state notice "No task box or link here"
key esc
wait 300
